      "no-continuous-object": "no object logic is under test here",
      "static-bg": "the background is not part of what this fixture proves",
      "no-storyboard": "a gate fixture, not a film: engine-doctrine/CRAFT/MOTION-REGISTERS.md #2 names the MD3 numbers this proves",
      "no-authored-motion": "the motion track IS the thing under test"
    }
  },
